  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:SacrCor">Prom. Reg.</ref> 1.2</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="1.2" corresp="#wit-cp">oðer is, þæt ic reaflac ⁊ ealle unrihte þing eallum hádum forbeode;</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="1.2" corresp="#wit-q">Aliud [est], ut rapacitates et omnes iniquitates omnibus gradibus interdicam.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="1.2" corresp="#wit-cp">oðer is, þæt ic reaflac ⁊ ealle unrihte þing eallum hádum forbeode;</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-cp">oðer is þæt ic reaflac and ealle unrihte þing eallum hadum forbeode;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-cp">Secondly, I forbid robbery and all unrighteous deeds by all classes of society.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-cp">second, that I forbid theft and all unjust things to all classes of people;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">das zweite ist, dass ich Raub und alle unrechten Dinge allen Ständen verbiete;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">the second is that I forbid robbery and all wrongful things to all ranks;</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Column O: Latin of the coronation liturgy.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
